cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use tach in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "tach: GPU utilization and efficiency through NVIDIA DCGM"
abstract: >-
  tach wraps a command and records GPU utilization and efficiency over time through NVIDIA
  DCGM, classifies the bottleneck with heuristic findings, and reports time, energy and cost
  per unit of work for comparing runs across instance types.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Friedman
    given-names: Scott A
    affiliation: Playground Logic LLC
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/scttfrdmn/tach"
keywords:
  - gpu
  - dcgm
  - hpc
  - right-sizing
  - energy
